  str_n18_15_name_desc_long = "Cloud Gardens' defense system is working, but this Eclipsite crisis is not yet solved. Nina and Minos can't agree on whether to stay or leave, which becomes the turning point of their bet. Did Minos expect this all along?",
  str_n18_16_name_desc_long = "Minos takes Nina and Sanae back to the Andersen mansion. Although Nina's world domination plan can't be carried out at Cloud Gardens, she has obviously got what she wants. After this incident, you've become more like a \"master.\" It is definitely a master's responsibility to cope with huge bills...",
